🚀 AB BATAO
Git commands chalao, phir mujhe batao:

Success ho gaya? ✅

Koi error aaya? → Screenshot ya text bhejo

Agar ho gaya, toh ab kya banana hai?

A) Backend structure (FastAPI files)

B) Frontend structure (React files)

C) docker-compose.yml

D) Database schema

E) LangGraph agent code

Bol bhai, aage badho! 🎯



