⚠️ IMPORTANT: .env.example File Bhi Banao
.gitignore me .env ignore kar rahe ho — lekin .env.example push karna zaroori hai taaki dusre developers ko pata chale kaunse variables chahiye.

.env.example file banao (root folder me):

env
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Is file ko copy karke .env banao aur apni values daalo:
#   cp .env.example .env
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🔐 APPLICATION
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
APP_NAME="Enterprise AI Workflow Orchestrator"
APP_ENV=development
DEBUG=True
SECRET_KEY=your-super-secret-key-change-this-in-production
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-jwt-secret-key-change-this
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🗄️ DATABASE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/workflow_db
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres
POSTGRES_DB=workflow_db
POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
POSTGRES_PORT=5432

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🤖 AI / GEMINI
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
GEMINI_TEMPERATURE=0.7
GEMINI_MAX_TOKENS=2048

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚡ TEMPORAL
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
TEMPORAL_HOST=localhost:7233
TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE=default
TEMPORAL_TASK_QUEUE=workflow-queue

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🌐 CORS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 📧 EMAIL (Optional - for notifications)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_app_password

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 💬 SLACK (Optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 📊 LOGGING
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
📋 STEPS TO CREATE
CMD me ye commands chalao:

cmd
cd C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator

notepad .gitignore
→ Upar wala FULL VERSION paste karo → Save (Ctrl+S)

cmd
notepad .env.example
→ Upar wala .env.example content paste karo → Save

Verify karo:

cmd
dir .gitignore .env.example
✅ VERIFY KARO KI SAHI HAI
Git ignore test karne ke liye:

cmd
git status
Agar .env, node_modules/, venv/, __pycache__/ — ye nahi dikhne chahiye status me ✅

Agar dikh rahi hain toh:

cmd
git rm -r --cached .
git add .
git status
🎯 KAUNSA VERSION USE KARNA HAI?
Situation	Use This
Full project (recommended)	Option 1 (Full Version)
Quick setup	Option 2 (Minimal)
Learning ke liye	Option 3 (Hinglish)
Actual project me	Option 1 + .env.example
Meri Recommendation: Option 1 (Full Version) + .env.example file — ye enterprise-level best practice hai.

🚀 AB KYA KARNA HAI
.gitignore banao (Option 1 copy karo)

.env.example banao (upar diya hai)

README.md banao (pehle diya tha)

Git push karo (pehle ke commands)

Batao ab kya chahiye:

A) README.md full detailed version

B) Backend requirements.txt

C) docker-compose.yml

D) Frontend package.json

Bol bhai! 🎯

git add comit push
🚀 Git Add → Commit → Push (Complete Guide)
Bhai, ye lo step-by-step commands — bilkul simple aur error-free. CMD kholo aur ye follow karo.

⚡ QUICK COMMANDS (Copy-Paste Order Me)
🔹 STEP 1: Project Folder Me Jao
cmd
cd C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator
⚠️ Apna actual path daalo. Agar path yaad nahi, toh folder pe right-click → "Copy as path" karo.

Verify karo tum sahi folder me ho:

cmd
dir
Output me .gitignore, README.md, etc. files dikhni chahiye.

🔹 STEP 2: Git Status Check Karo (Kya Change Hua)
cmd
git status
Ye batayega:

Kaunsi files new hain (untracked)

Kaunsi files modified hain

Kaunsi files staged hain (ready to commit)

🔹 STEP 3: Saari Files Add Karo (Staging)
cmd
git add .
Ye kya karta hai: Saari new + modified files ko "staging area" me daalta hai — matlab "ye files commit karni hain".

Alternative (specific file):

cmd
git add README.md
git add .gitignore
git add backend/
Alternative (saari files with confirmation):

cmd
git add -A
🔹 STEP 4: Verify Karo Kya Add Hua
cmd
git status
Ab green color me files dikhni chahiye — matlab ye staged hain.

Agar koi file red me hai, toh wo add nahi hui — dobara git add <filename> karo.

🔹 STEP 5: Commit Banao
cmd
git commit -m "Initial commit: Enterprise AI Workflow Orchestrator"
Output aayega:

text
[main (root-commit) abc1234] Initial commit: Enterprise AI Workflow Orchestrator
 5 files changed, 250 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore
 create mode 100644 README.md
 ...
Good commit messages (future ke liye):

cmd
git commit -m "feat: add backend FastAPI structure"
git commit -m "feat: add LangGraph agent nodes"
git commit -m "fix: resolve Temporal retry issue"
git commit -m "docs: update README with setup guide"
git commit -m "chore: add docker-compose for local dev"
🔹 STEP 6: Remote Origin Set Karo (Agar nahi kiya)
cmd
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator.git
Verify karo:

cmd
git remote -v
Output:

text
origin  https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator.git (fetch)
origin  https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator.git (push)
⚠️ Agar error: remote origin already exists aaye, toh skip karo — already set hai.

🔹 STEP 7: Branch main Confirm Karo
cmd
git branch -M main
Ye current branch ka naam main kar dega (GitHub default).

🔹 STEP 8: Push Karo GitHub Pe 🚀
cmd
git push -u origin main
Pehli baar push karte waqt:

Username: vishakha2121

Password: PAT (Personal Access Token) — apna GitHub password NAHI

🔐 PAT (Personal Access Token) Kaise Banaye
Jab push karte waqt password maange, PAT use karo (GitHub ne password auth band kar diya hai).

Steps:
Browser me jao: https://github.com/settings/tokens

"Generate new token" → "Generate new token (classic)"

Note: workflow-orchestrator-upload

Expiration: 90 days

Scopes: ✅ repo (poora check karo)

"Generate token" click

Token copy karo (ek baar hi dikhta hai — safe jagah save karo!)

Push karte waqt:
text
Username: vishakha2121
Password: ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx  ← PAT paste karo
Windows Credential Manager me save ho jayega — agli baar nahi maangega.

🎯 COMPLETE COMMAND BLOCK (Ek Saath)
Agar sab ready hai, toh ye poora block ek-ek karke CMD me paste karo:

cmd
cd C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator

git status

git add .

git status

git commit -m "Initial commit: Enterprise AI Workflow Orchestrator"

git branch -M main

git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator.git

git push -u origin main
⚠️ COMMON ERRORS & FIXES
❌ Error 1: nothing to commit, working tree clean
Matlab koi change nahi hai. Check karo:

cmd
git status
Agar files already committed hain, toh commit skip karo.

❌ Error 2: remote origin already exists
cmd
git remote remove origin
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator.git
❌ Error 3: failed to push some refs / rejected
GitHub pe README already hai, local me nahi. Fix:

cmd
git pull origin main --allow-unrelated-histories
git push -u origin main
Agar merge conflict aaye:

Notepad khulega → conflict resolve karo

Save karo

Phir:

cmd
git add .
git commit -m "Merge remote README"
git push -u origin main
❌ Error 4: Authentication failed
PAT use karo (password nahi)

Ya Windows Credential Manager se purana delete karo:

cmd
cmdkey /list | findstr github
cmdkey /delete:git:https://github.com
Phir dobara push karo.

❌ Error 5: src refspec main does not match any
Matlab commit nahi hua. Check:

cmd
git log
Agar empty hai, toh git add . + git commit dobara karo.

❌ Error 6: fatal: not a git repository
Matlab git init nahi kiya ya galat folder me ho:

cmd
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator.git
git push -u origin main
❌ Error 7: .env accidentally push ho gaya 😱
Turant ye karo:

cmd
git rm --cached .env
echo .env >> .gitignore
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Remove .env from tracking"
git push
Aur Gemini API key rotate karo (purani delete, nayi banao).

🔄 FUTURE UPDATES (Jab Bhi Code Change Karo)
Har baar code change karne ke baad 3 commands:

cmd
git add .
git commit -m "your message here"
git push
Example:

cmd
git add .
git commit -m "feat: add workflow execution endpoint"
git push
📋 FINAL CHECKLIST
□ CMD me project folder me gaye
□ git status chala (kya change hai dekha)
□ git add . chala
□ git status chala (verify green color)
□ git commit -m "message" chala
□ git branch -M main chala
□ git remote add origin ... chala
□ PAT banaya (agar pehli baar)
□ git push -u origin main chala
□ GitHub pe verify kiya
✅ VERIFY: GitHub Pe Check Karo
Browser me jao:

text
https://github.com/vishakha2121/enterprise-ai-workflow-orchestrator
Refresh (F5) karo — tumhari files dikhni chahiye:

✅ .gitignore

✅ README.md

✅ Baaki files (jo bhi banaayi)

Latest commit message bhi dikhega top pe.

