AI Workflow Orchestrator Project Guide
📄 Complete .gitignore File
Bhai, ye lo production-quality .gitignore file — tumhare full-stack project (Python + React + Temporal + Docker + Postgres) ke liye specially banayi hai.

🎯 OPTION 1: FULL VERSION (Recommended - Sabse Best)
Ye complete .gitignore hai. Project root folder me .gitignore naam se file banao aur ye content paste kar do.

